    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis charming two bedroom semi detached home sits quietly within a small cul de sac of just eight houses, offering a rare sense of calm only moments from the vibrant heart of Monkstown Village. With the hugely popular Seapoint swimming spot practically on your doorstep and the village just a two minute walk away, the location blends coastal living with everyday convenience in a way few homes can match.\n\nThe ground floor is arranged for easy, comfortable living. A bright kitchen positioned to the front of the house provides a welcoming start to the day, while the dining and living room to the rear forms a warm, inviting space ideal for relaxing or entertaining. This room opens directly onto the private back garden, a beautifully secluded haven finished in low maintenance paving and surrounded by mature planting. It's an idyllic setting for alfresco dining, quiet mornings, or long summer evenings outdoors.\n\nUpstairs, the home offers two well proportioned double bedrooms, each filled with natural light and offering flexible space for rest, work, or storage. A neatly appointed main bathroom completes the accommodation, providing comfort and practicality in equal measure.\n\nThere is parking directly outside the house for the residents and is ample for the number of houses in the cul de sac. The Dart is a short walk away while there are several bus routes very close to the house on Monkstown road with direct links to the City Centre.\n\nAltogether, this home combines tranquillity, coastal charm, and village convenience, making it an exceptional opportunity in one of Dublin's most desirable neighbourhoods.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright entrance hall with carpet flooring and a spacious cloakroom for storage.\n\nKitchen - 2.42m x 2.04m\nKitchen with wall and floor hung units, vynal flooring, stainless steel sink with window, flooding kitchen with light, integrated oven and electric hob, free standing fridge/freezer, washng machine.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.83m x 4.00m\nLarge open plan living room with carpet flooring, fireplace with alcoves, dining area, double glass doors and window opening out onto private sunny garden.\n\nMain double bedroom - 3.14m x 3.93m\nSpacious double bedroom to the front of the house, dual windows for natural light and ventilation, built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.32m x 4.00m\nDouble bedroom to the back of the house with carpet flooring, window overlooking the garden, built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.69m x 2.09m\nSpacious bathroom with privacy window for natural light and ventilation, tiled walls, bath and shower. Washhand basin and WC.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Lovely two bedroom property</li><li>Semi-detached</li><li>Close to Monkstown and Blackrock Villages</li><li>Swimming at Seapoint a short stroll</li><li>Good transport links bus and DART</li><li>Low maintenance private rear garden</ul>"
      },
